<title>CROATIA: TENNIS-CROATIAN INDOOR MEN'S TOURNAMENT SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CROATIAN INDOOR MEN'S TOURNAMENT SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-02-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the Croatian indoor men's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat 5-Javier Sanchez (Spain) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Greg Rusedski (Britain) beat 2-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
